## Dry Run

Consider:

```text
N = 5
K = 2
S = 01010
```

Process from left to right.

```text
Position 0 → 0
```

Already `0`, so keep it.

```text
Position 1 → 1
```

Flip positions `1..2`.

```text
01010
 ↓
00110
```

Continue processing while tracking the flip effect efficiently.

The greedy process eventually produces:

```text
00000
```

which is the lexicographically smallest possible result.

